# Candidate overlayfs whiteouts, by stage (docs/slim.md). Paths are relative
# to Waydroid's overlay root (/var/lib/waydroid/overlay). "<stage> <path>".
# Phase 2 applies them stage by stage; what survives goes to image/whiteouts.

