# S2 is props and init.zygote64.rc only (no whiteouts).

# S3: SystemUI. Its windows never reach Marathon in multi-window mode, Monet
# is off, notifications go through DeckardBridge, Launcher3 is gone.
S3 system/system_ext/priv-app/SystemUI
